# --- Git metadata / 仓库元数据 ---
.git/**
.gitignore

# --- Repo helper files not needed in the published package ---
# 发布用不到、也不该带出去的仓库辅助内容
.github/**
docs/**
ci/**
.agents/**
Dockerfile.ci
PROMO.md

# --- VS Code dev config（含 launch.json，可能含机器相关路径）/ dev config ---
.vscode/**

# --- Tests & scratch data / 测试与临时数据 ---
.vscode-test/**
.playwright-cli/**
test/**
scripts/**
smoke*.js
dsh-instances.json
.smoke-storage/**
# DSH tool-scratch dirs must never ship (accept-test, repair workspaces, ...)
.dsh-*/**

# Repo-internal planning/audit notes stay out of the VSIX
USABILITY-AUDIT.md
PLAN-*.md
HANDOFF-*.md
VERSIONS.md
# Local tool-scratch probes (never ship)
dsh-write-probe.txt
helloworld.js
thinking-effort-loaded.json

# --- Internal orchestration notes stay in the repository, never in the VSIX ---
# 内部编排/QA 笔记只留在仓库里，绝不进入发布包
KNOWN_ISSUES.md
planning/**
**/planning/**
docs/**
**/*_IMPL_NOTES.md
**/*_QA_FINDINGS.md
**/*_CLEANUP_NOTES.md

# --- Local orchestration lanes / 本地编排 worktree 与 deepwork 进度 ---
.slim/**

# --- Build artifacts / 构建产物 ---
**/*.map
**/*.log
**/node_modules/**
*.vsix

# 以下文件默认保留在包里：README.md、CHANGELOG.md、LICENSE、media/、src/（勿在
# 这里忽略它们）。The following stay in the package: README.md, CHANGELOG.md,
# LICENSE, media/, src/ (do not ignore them here).
